    "description": "<p>This is the dataset for 2023 Cephalometric Landmark Detection Challenge (CL-Detection2023).&nbsp;<strong>Each team needs to send a submit the <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1y2sR_ymKpSjCdQemCjGN9YazsFO1fmsN/view?usp=share_link\">Registration Form</a>&nbsp;first to Prof Wang (cweiwang@mail.ntust.edu.tw; cwwang1979@gmail.com) and Mr. Hikam Muzakky (m11123801@mail.ntust.edu.tw)</strong></p>\n\n<p>The CL-Detection 2023 cephalometric landmark detection challenge is held on <a href=\"https://conferences.miccai.org/2023/en/\">2023 MICCAI conference</a>.</p>\n\n<p>Teams are required to register on the Grand Challenge site before they will be given access to the data.&nbsp;Each team needs to send a registration email including the team name, team members&#39; names, and affiliations to the organizer to Prof Wang (cweiwang@mail.ntust.edu.tw; cwwang1979@gmail.com) and Mr. Hikam Muzakky (m11123801@mail.ntust.edu.tw)</p>\n\n<p>No publication rights are given on this data.&nbsp;The data may only be used for the purpose of the&nbsp;challenge.&nbsp;This is due to constraints imposed on use of the data by the ethics approval.</p>",
    "publication_date": "2023-03-31",
    "publisher": "Zenodo",
